Snap website

This repository contains the Snap product landing page and local demonstration recordings.
Snap is based on the upstream Proma desktop application by ErlichLiu and contributors.
Upstream project: https://github.com/proma-ai/Proma
Upstream website: https://proma.cool/

Visual design follows the style specification supplied for this Snap website.
Typography: Inter, distributed under the SIL Open Font License; see assets/fonts/LICENSE-Inter.txt.
The supplied Snap brand mark is retained as the product identity.

The upstream AGPL-3.0 license text is preserved in LICENSE.
The demonstrations show the product before its name changed to Snap.
